{
  "_meta": {
    "title": "LTX VFX: Paint fluid (IC-LoRA ainvfx-fluid)",
    "description": "Core ComfyUI nodes only (LTX-2.5 support in ComfyUI core). Distilled LTX-2.5 22B (int8), 8 fixed sigmas, euler_ancestral, cfg 1 (LTXVDualCFGGuider 1/1). IC-LoRA: AInVFX ainvfx-fluid (strength 1.0, trigger ainvfxfluid, reference downscale factor 2 read by GetICLoRAParameters) -> LTXVAddGuide(frame_idx 0, strength 1). The control video is built in-graph as the card describes: painted first frame at index 0, black frames (EmptyImage) in between, painted last frame at the final index (ImageBatch), same size and length as the output, size /64. Flat colour blobs become smoke, steam or fire. Card negative. No audio. LTX-2.x Community License (ltx-2.x-community-license)."
